# 40-ai-side-hustle — build artifacts and secrets
#
# The output/ directory is generated by `make demo` / `make simulate-30d`
# and re-creatable from scratch. It's intentionally NOT tracked so a
# fresh clone starts clean and the repo stays small (the tracked
# output/ is ~480KB of generated PDFs/HTML that buys the buyer nothing).
# The first run after `make install` recreates it.
#
# ledger.db is the SQLite revenue ledger. Treat it like a local
# database — it gets the buyer's real sales data once they connect
# a real revenue source. Never track it.

# Generated assets
output/
ledger.db

# Local secrets (mirror the root .gitignore for this subdir)
.env
.env.*
*.env
!*.env.example

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
